  "abstract_summary": "BuildOcc provides LLM-based occupant agents for building energy simulation, grounded in American Time Use Survey (ATUS) microdata. It offers a Python agent library, a REST API, and an MCP server, with ATUS-grounded activity scheduling across four demographic strata, persona generation with EIA RECS appliance priors,...",
